   332	    Return a list with all report files which belong to a system user.
   333	    The maximum system user group ID is taken from SYS_UID_MAX from
   334	    /etc/login.defs (defaults to 999 on Debian based systems and LSB
   335	    specifies 499 in "User ID Ranges").
